iVentoy Package for Synology DSM
=================================

This package redistributes the iVentoy binary which is PROPRIETARY SOFTWARE,
distributed under the iVentoy Free Edition license.

IMPORTANT LICENSE RESTRICTIONS (from iVentoy Free Edition):
  - Free Edition is for PERSONAL and NON-COMMERCIAL use ONLY.
  - Maximum 20 concurrent client boots.
  - x86_64 architecture only.
  - Redistribution rights are NOT granted by the Free Edition license.

This spksrc package is provided for personal use only. It is NOT intended for
redistribution via SynoCommunity or any public package repository. Users are
responsible for compliance with iVentoy's license terms.

The iVentoy binary itself is governed by:
  - https://www.ventoy.net/en/iventoy.html
  - iVentoy Free Edition License (see doc/ inside the binary tarball)

Open-source components bundled with iVentoy (glib2, libevent, libiconv, etc.)
retain their respective licenses (LGPL, BSD-3, etc.).

This packaging work (Makefile, scripts, wizard, nginx config) is provided AS-IS
under MIT-style license for personal use.

NO WARRANTY. Use at your own risk. Keep iVentoy and your DSM system updated.